{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "1CO",
  "chapter": 1,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Paul, called ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " an apostle of Jesus Christ through the will of God, and Sosthenes ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "our",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " brother,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To the church of God which is at Corinth, to them that are sanctified in Christ Jesus, called ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " saints, with all that in every place call upon the name of Jesus Christ our Lord, both theirs and ours.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Grace ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to you, and peace from God our Father, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "from",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the Lord Jesus Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I thank my God always on your behalf, for the grace of God which is given you by Jesus Christ;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That in every thing ye are enriched by him, in all utterance, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all knowledge;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even as the testimony of Christ was confirmed in you:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So that ye come behind in no gift; waiting for the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who will also confirm you to the end, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that ye may be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " blameless in the day of our Lord Jesus Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " faithful, by whom ye were called to the fellowship of his Son Jesus Christ our Lord.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now I beseech you, brethren, by the name of our Lord Jesus Christ, that ye all speak the same thing, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " there be no divisions among you; but ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ye be perfectly joined together in the same mind, and in the same judgment.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For it hath been declared to me concerning you, my brethren, by them ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who are of the house",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of Chloe, that there are contentions among you.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now this I say, that every one of you saith, I am of Paul; and I of Apollos; and I of Cephas; and I of Christ.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Is Christ divided? was Paul crucified for you? or were ye baptized in the name of Paul?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I thank God that I baptized none of you, but Crispus and Gaius;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lest any should say that I had baptized in my own name.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And I baptized also the household of Stephanas; besides, I know not whether I baptized any other.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For Christ hath not sent me to baptize, but to preach the gospel: not with wisdom of words, lest the cross of Christ should be made of no effect.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the preaching of the cross is to them that perish, foolishness; but to us who are saved, it is the power of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For it is written, I will destroy the wisdom of the wise, and will bring to nothing the understanding of the prudent.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the wise? where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the scribe? where ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the disputer of this world? hath not God made foolish the wisdom of this world?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For when in the wisdom of God the world by wisdom knew not God, it pleased God by the foolishness of preaching to save them that believe.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the Jews require a sign, and the Greeks seek wisdom:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But we preach Christ crucified, to the Jews a stumbling-block, and to the Greeks foolishness;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But to them who are called, both Jews and Greeks, Christ the power of God, and the wisdom of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because the foolishness of God is wiser than men; and the weakness of God is stronger than men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ye see your calling, brethren, that not many wise men after the flesh, not many mighty, not many noble ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are called",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ":",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But God hath chosen the foolish things of the world to confound the wise; and God hath chosen the weak things of the world to confound the things which are mighty;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And base things of the world, and things which are despised, hath God chosen, and things which are not, to bring to naught things that are:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That no flesh should glory in his presence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But of him are ye in Christ Jesus, who from God is made to us wisdom, and righteousness, and sanctification, and redemption:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "1CO.1.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:1CO.1.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That, according as it is written, He that glorieth, let him glory in the Lord.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
